    <string name="settings_about_title">ShelfOS · Early development</string>
    <string name="settings_about_body">A local-first personal library for files you own. Add PDF, EPUB and CBZ publications with Add file; they stay where they are. Nothing is uploaded and no account is needed.</string>
    <string name="settings_keyboard_help">Keyboard: Tab or arrow keys to move, Enter to select, Ctrl+F to search. In a reader: arrows, Page Up/Down or Space to turn pages, Menu for controls, Escape to go back. Gamepad: D-pad to move, A to select, B to go back, L1/R1 to turn pages.</string>
